    "lesson": {
      "title": "Market equilibrium",
      "instruction": "Shift supply and demand curves. Observe the market clearing price, traded quantity, and economic surplus.",
      "explanation": "In a competitive market, equilibrium is reached where quantity demanded equals quantity supplied. Price ceilings below equilibrium create shortages, while floors above create surpluses."
    },
